      "math_academy_id": "e-1102",
      "problem": "What is the domain of the function $f(x)$ defined by the following table? \n\n| $x$ | $\\,-2\\,$ | $\\,-1\\,$ | $\\,0\\,$ | $\\,2\\,$ | $\\,4\\,$ | $\\,6\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $-2$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $1$ | $2$ |",
